flowchart TD
    A[Payload built by data_formatter] --> B[offline_queue_enqueue]
    B --> C{SD log enabled}
    C -->|No| H[Return]
    C -->|Yes| D[sd_log_store_append]
    D --> E[queue.log and queue.dat]

    F[offline_queue_replay_tick] --> G{online and MQTT connected}
    G -->|No| H
    G -->|Yes| I[sd_log_store_peek_next replay_seq]
    I --> J{critical record}
    J -->|No| K[publish and advance replay_seq]
    J -->|Yes| L[publish and keep pending_msg_id]
    L --> M[puback callback from mqtt_client]
    M --> N[ack critical and advance replay_seq]
    K --> O[retry reset]
    N --> O
    O --> H
